            <div xml:id="d898">

                <pb facs="0892" n="726" xml:id="pg726"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 439.00/8</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of the Navy to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Navy Department</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-08-15">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 15, 1917</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Secretary of the Navy presents his compliments to the Honorable the Secretary
                    of State, and desires that I forward herewith for the information of the
                    Department of State certain correspondence from the Military Governor of Santo
                    Domingo and the Military Representative of the United States in Haiti, under
                    date of July 30, 1917, relative to the inauguration of the Dominican Claims
                    Commission of 1917, and desires that the enclosed correspondence be returned to
                    this Department when it has served its purpose in the Department of State.</p>
                <p>Very respectfully,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">C. Belknap</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Lieutenant Commander, U.S.N.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d898-a1.xml" xpointer="d898-a1"/>
            </div>
